WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.678 --> 00:00:25.064
The golden coach started down the road.

2
00:00:25.065 --> 00:00:28.038
"Wait!" Godmother called.

3
00:00:28.039 --> 00:00:31.065
The coach stopped.

4
00:00:31.066 --> 00:00:34.531
Cinderella looked back. "What is it?"

5
00:00:34.532 --> 00:00:39.093
"You must obey one rule tonight," Godmother said.

6
00:00:39.094 --> 00:00:43.239
"You must leave the ball by midnight or . . ."

7
00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:46.924
"Yes?" Cinderella asked.

8
00:00:46.925 --> 00:00:49.432
"Poof!" Godmother said.

9
00:00:49.433 --> 00:00:53.072
"Your golden coach will disappear.

10
00:00:53.073 --> 00:00:57.275
Your clothes will turn back into rags."

11
00:00:57.276 --> 00:01:01.217
Cinderella nodded. "I promise, Godmother.

12
00:01:01.218 --> 00:01:04.371
I will leave the ball by midnight."

13
00:01:04.372 --> 00:01:06.560
The horses took off again.

14
00:01:06.561 --> 00:01:16.359
"Thank you!" Cinderella called.

15
00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:24.944
At the ball the prince danced with many fine ladies.

16
00:01:24.945 --> 00:01:30.218
One fine lady talked too much.

17
00:01:30.219 --> 00:01:35.783
One fine lady danced too fast.

18
00:01:35.784 --> 00:01:42.626
One fine lady stepped on his toes.

19
00:01:42.627 --> 00:01:48.039
"This is boring," the prince thought.

20
00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:54.096
He went outside and sighed.

21
00:01:54.097 --> 00:01:57.290
There were many fine ladies at the ball.

22
00:01:57.291 --> 00:02:02.238
But he didn't want to marry any of them.

23
00:02:02.239 --> 00:02:06.217
Just then the prince spotted something.

24
00:02:06.218 --> 00:02:10.654
A golden coach was coming.

25
00:02:10.655 --> 00:02:13.380
"Who's that?" he said.

26
00:02:13.381 --> 00:02:17.906
"It looks like a beautiful princess!"

27
00:02:17.907 --> 00:02:27.927
The golden coach arrived at the palace.

28
00:02:27.928 --> 00:02:31.477
Cinderella saw a handsome young man.

29
00:02:31.478 --> 00:02:38.420
"The prince!" she whispered.

30
00:02:38.421 --> 00:02:40.891
The prince rushed down the steps.

31
00:02:40.892 --> 00:02:43.370
"Hello," he said softly.

32
00:02:43.371 --> 00:02:48.129
He bowed and took Cinderella's hand.

33
00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:55.555
The prince and Cinderella entered the ballroom.

34
00:02:55.556 --> 00:02:58.873
Everyone hushed.

35
00:02:58.874 --> 00:03:02.408
"Who is that?" they whispered.

36
00:03:02.409 --> 00:03:11.211
"Who is that beautiful princess?"
